<title>GREECE: BEFORE THE BELL: STOCKS TRADE EX-DIV TUESDAY.</title>
<headline>BEFORE THE BELL: STOCKS TRADE EX-DIV TUESDAY.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Athens stock exchange said</p>
<p>shares of the following companies will trade ex-dividend on</p>
<p>Tuesday:</p>
<p>COMPANY	   DIV/SHARE	 ADJUSTED STARTING PRICE</p>
<p>Etem		 170			5,575</p>
<p>Athena		50			1,460</p>
<p>Radio Athinai     55			  660</p>
<p>			55			  594</p>
<p>--Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
